empty: ok 0
zero blocks: ok 0
flipped: Corrupt: a header has a wrong checksum
cut in header: Corrupt: the archive ends inside a header
cut in data: Corrupt: the archive ends inside an entry
gzip: Corrupt
special: Unsupported: "dev" is a special file, which tar.write cannot make
empty name: BadEntry: an entry has an empty name
link no target: BadEntry: the link "l" has no target
ok: ok 2048
